    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nThe Power Up button is already wired up. Use it as a model to build another button.\r\n\r\n1. Look at `powerUp` and `getUpdatedPower` in `script.js`. Notice how `getUpdatedPower` uses `return` to send back the updated value.\r\n\r\n2. Open `spec.md` and pick one button to build.\r\n\r\n3. Under your chosen spec in `spec.md`, finish the sentences.\r\n\r\n4. Highlight your button's full spec and send it to AI Tutor. Ask for a helper function that uses `return` and a named arrow function that updates the page.\r\n\r\n5. Write an `addEventListener` line to connect your function, then click the button to test it.",
    "display_name": "Game HUD",
    "start_sources": {
      "folders": {
      },
      "files": {
        "1": {
          "id": "1",
          "name": "index.html",
          "language": "html",
          "contents": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <title>NEONRIFT</title>\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n  <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chakra+Petch:wght@500;600;700&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n  <script defer src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"phone\">\n\n    <!-- Top bar: game brand + player chip -->\n    <header class=\"hud-header\">\n      <div class=\"brand\">\n        <span class=\"brand-mark\">⌬</span>\n        <span class=\"brand-name\">NEONRIFT</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"player-chip\">\n        <span class=\"player-avatar\">D</span>\n        <div class=\"player-info\">\n          <span class=\"player-name\">devon_77</span>\n          <span class=\"player-rank\">DIAMOND III</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Status line -->\n    <div class=\"status-line\">\n      <span class=\"status-dot\"></span>\n      IN MATCH — ROUND 3 OF 5\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Stat readouts -->\n    <section class=\"stat-grid\">\n      <div class=\"stat-card stat-card-health\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">HEALTH</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"healthDisplay\">100</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-bar\"><div class=\"stat-bar-fill stat-bar-fill-health\"></div></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"stat-card stat-card-power\">\n        <div class=\"stat-label\">POWER</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-value\" id=\"powerDisplay\">1</div>\n        <div class=\"stat-meta\">MULTIPLIER ACTIVE</div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Action buttons -->\n    <section class=\"actions\">\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">ACTIONS</h2>\n      <div class=\"button-grid\">\n        <button id=\"powerUpButton\" class=\"hud-btn hud-btn-power\">\n          <span class=\"hud-btn-glyph\">▲</span>\n          <span class=\"hud-btn-text\">POWER UP</span>\n        </button>\n        <button id=\"loseHealthButton\" class=\"hud-btn hud-btn-damage\">\n          <span class=\"hud-btn-glyph\">✕</span>\n          <span class=\"hud-btn-text\">TAKE DAMAGE</span>\n        </button>\n        <button id=\"healButton\" class=\"hud-btn hud-btn-heal\">\n          <span class=\"hud-btn-glyph\">+</span>\n          <span class=\"hud-btn-text\">HEAL</span>\n        </button>\n        <button id=\"resetButton\" class=\"hud-btn hud-btn-reset\">\n          <span class=\"hud-btn-glyph\">↻</span>\n          <span class=\"hud-btn-text\">RESET</span>\n        </button>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Decorative recent matches -->\n    <section class=\"recent\">\n      <div class=\"recent-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"section-title\">RECENT MATCHES</h2>\n        <span class=\"recent-link\">ALL →</span>\n      </div>\n      <ul class=\"match-list\">\n        <li class=\"match-item match-win\">\n          <div class=\"match-result\">WIN</div>\n          <div class=\"match-info\">\n            <div class=\"match-title\">vs. shadowzone</div>\n            <div class=\"match-meta\">12 PTS · 4 ASSISTS · 27 MIN</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"match-rank\">+24 LP</div>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"match-item match-loss\">\n          <div class=\"match-result\">LOSS</div>\n          <div class=\"match-info\">\n            <div class=\"match-title\">vs. orbital_six</div>\n            <div class=\"match-meta\">8 PTS · 11 ASSISTS · 31 MIN</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"match-rank\">−18 LP</div>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"match-item match-win\">\n          <div class=\"match-result\">WIN</div>\n          <div class=\"match-info\">\n            <div class=\"match-title\">vs. cryotek</div>\n            <div class=\"match-meta\">15 PTS · 6 ASSISTS · 22 MIN</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"match-rank\">+22 LP</div>\n        </li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>",
          "active": false,
          "folderId": "0"
        },
        "2": {
          "id": "2",
          "name": "style.css",
          "language": "css",
          "contents": "* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;\n  background: #0e1420;\n  color: #e8eaed;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  padding: 24px 16px;\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  /* subtle scanline texture */\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.02) 50%, transparent 50%);\n  background-size: 100% 3px;\n}\n\n.phone {\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 380px;\n  background: #0e1420;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.25);\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  padding: 20px 18px 24px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.08);\n}\n\n/* ─── Header ─── */\n.hud-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-bottom: 14px;\n}\n\n.brand {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.brand-mark {\n  width: 28px;\n  height: 28px;\n  border: 1px solid #00e5ff;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.8);\n  clip-path: polygon(6px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 6px), calc(100% - 6px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 6px);\n}\n\n.brand-name {\n  font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  color: #ffffff;\n}\n\n.player-chip {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  background: #161e2e;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);\n  padding: 4px 10px 4px 4px;\n  border-radius: 2px;\n}\n\n.player-avatar {\n  width: 26px;\n  height: 26px;\n  background: #00e5ff;\n  color: #0e1420;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.6);\n}\n\n.player-info {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  line-height: 1.1;\n}\n\n.player-name {\n  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  color: #e8eaed;\n}\n\n.player-rank {\n  font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n}\n\n/* ─── Status line ─── */\n.status-line {\n  display: inline-flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  background: rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.1);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.4);\n  color: #ff006e;\n  font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  padding: 5px 10px;\n  margin-bottom: 18px;\n}\n\n.status-dot {\n  width: 6px;\n  height: 6px;\n  background: #ff006e;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.9);\n  animation: pulse 1.2s ease-in-out infinite;\n}\n\n@keyframes pulse {\n  0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }\n  50% { opacity: 0.3; }\n}\n\n/* ─── Stat cards ─── */\n.stat-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 10px;\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n}\n\n.stat-card {\n  background: #161e2e;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.3);\n  padding: 14px 14px 12px;\n  position: relative;\n  clip-path: polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 10px), calc(100% - 10px) 100%, 0 100%);\n}\n\n.stat-card-health {\n  border-color: rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.4);\n}\n\n.stat-label {\n  font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  color: #7a8298;\n  margin-bottom: 6px;\n}\n\n.stat-value {\n  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 38px;\n  line-height: 1;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  margin-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.stat-card-health .stat-value {\n  color: #ff006e;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.5);\n}\n\n.stat-card-power .stat-value {\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.5);\n}\n\n.stat-bar {\n  height: 4px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.stat-bar-fill {\n  height: 100%;\n  width: 100%;\n  background: #ff006e;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.8);\n}\n\n.stat-meta {\n  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\n\n/* ─── Section titles ─── */\n.section-title {\n  font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  color: #e8eaed;\n  margin-bottom: 12px;\n}\n\n/* ─── Action buttons ─── */\n.actions {\n  margin-bottom: 22px;\n}\n\n.button-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 10px;\n}\n\n.hud-btn {\n  font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  background: transparent;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  border: 1px solid #00e5ff;\n  padding: 12px 10px;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.25), inset 0 0 12px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.05);\n  clip-path: polygon(8px 0, 100% 0, 100% calc(100% - 8px), calc(100% - 8px) 100%, 0 100%, 0 8px);\n  transition: box-shadow 0.12s ease, transform 0.06s ease;\n}\n\n.hud-btn:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.5), inset 0 0 12px rgba(0, 229, 255, 0.1);\n}\n\n.hud-btn:active {\n  transform: scale(0.97);\n}\n\n.hud-btn-glyph {\n  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n  font-size: 14px;\n  opacity: 0.9;\n}\n\n.hud-btn-power {\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  border-color: #00e5ff;\n}\n\n.hud-btn-damage {\n  color: #ff006e;\n  border-color: #ff006e;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.25), inset 0 0 12px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.05);\n}\n.hud-btn-damage:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.5), inset 0 0 12px rgba(255, 0, 110, 0.1);\n}\n\n.hud-btn-heal {\n  color: #39ff14;\n  border-color: #39ff14;\n  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.25), inset 0 0 12px rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.05);\n}\n.hud-btn-heal:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.5), inset 0 0 12px rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.1);\n}\n\n.hud-btn-reset {\n  color: #7a8298;\n  border-color: #7a8298;\n  box-shadow: none;\n}\n.hud-btn-reset:hover {\n  box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(122, 130, 152, 0.3);\n}\n\n/* ─── Recent matches ─── */\n.recent-header {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: baseline;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n}\n\n.recent-link {\n  font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 10px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  color: #00e5ff;\n  opacity: 0.7;\n}\n\n.match-list {\n  list-style: none;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\n.match-item {\n  background: #161e2e;\n  border-left: 2px solid #7a8298;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.match-win {\n  border-left-color: #39ff14;\n}\n\n.match-loss {\n  border-left-color: #ff006e;\n}\n\n.match-result {\n  font-family: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 11px;\n  letter-spacing: 0.1em;\n  width: 38px;\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n}\n\n.match-win .match-result {\n  color: #39ff14;\n}\n\n.match-loss .match-result {\n  color: #ff006e;\n}\n\n.match-info {\n  flex: 1;\n  min-width: 0;\n}\n\n.match-title {\n  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #e8eaed;\n}\n\n.match-meta {\n  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n  font-weight: 500;\n  font-size: 9px;\n  color: #7a8298;\n  letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.match-rank {\n  font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 12px;\n  color: #7a8298;\n}\n\n.match-win .match-rank {\n  color: #39ff14;\n}\n\n.match-loss .match-rank {\n  color: #ff006e;\n}",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "3": {
          "id": "3",
          "name": "script.js",
          "language": "js",
          "contents": "// State variables for the player's stats\nlet health = 100;\nlet power = 1;\n\n// Get references to the display elements\nconst healthDisplay = document.getElementById(\"healthDisplay\");\nconst powerDisplay = document.getElementById(\"powerDisplay\");\n\n// Helper function: calculates the updated power\nconst getUpdatedPower = () => {\n  return power * 2;\n};\n\n// Named arrow function: doubles the player's power\nconst powerUp = () => {\n  power = getUpdatedPower();\n  powerDisplay.textContent = power;\n};\n\n// Connect the function to the Power Up button\nconst powerUpButton = document.getElementById(\"powerUpButton\");\npowerUpButton.addEventListener(\"click\", powerUp);\n\n// === Add your code below ===",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": false
        },
        "4": {
          "id": "4",
          "name": "spec.md",
          "contents": "---\nName of Button: Power Up   ← Already done as the example\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: The player's power increases\nWhat on the page changes: The power readout updates\n---\n\n\nName of Button: Take Damage\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: The player loses some health\nWhat on the page changes: The health readout updates\n[Specify] When this button is clicked, I want:\n[Predict] I think the AI's function will:\n[Return] The helper function should return:\n\nName of Button: Heal\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: The player gains back some health\nWhat on the page changes: The health readout updates\n[Specify] When this button is clicked, I want:\n[Predict] I think the AI's function will:\n[Return] The helper function should return:\n\nName of Button: Reset\nEvent: click\nWhat should happen: Reset everything to start over\nWhat on the page changes: Health and power return to their starting state\n[Specify] When this button is clicked, I want:\n[Predict] I think the AI's function will:\n[Return] The helper function should return:",
          "folderId": "0",
          "active": true
        }
      },
      "openFiles": [
        "4",
        "3"
      ]
